title: room.enter
---
<<if not $sawStreet>>
Fog swallows the street. A hansom waits at the kerb, its lamps two blurs of light. #line:101-001
<<set $sawStreet to true>>
<<endif>>
===

title: room.look
---
Baker Street at night, or as much of it as the fog allows. #line:101-002
===

title: cab.look
---
A hansom, the horse steaming in the cold. #line:101-003
===

title: cab.do
---
<<walk hero 190 156>>
Hero: Clerkenwell, cabby, and quickly. #line:101-004
Watson: There's a sovereign in it if you can find the way in this. #line:101-005
<<sound 131 wait>>
<<room 102>>
===

title: lamp.look
---
The gas lamp makes a small room of light in the fog. #line:101-006
===

title: door221.look
---
The door of 221B. Mrs Hudson's lamp still burns in the hall. #line:101-007
===

title: door221.do
---
Hero: No time for that now. Thorne has been gone a night already. #line:101-008
===

title: watson.look
---
My collar is up against the fog, for all the good it does. #line:101-009
===

title: watson.talk
---
Watson: Clerkenwell at this hour. The cabby will want double. #line:101-010
===
